mutt is the email client.

Navigation:
	j/k - Move down/up
	d/u - Move down/up half page
	gg/G - Move to top/bottom
	gi/gs/gd/gS - Go to inbox/sent/drafts/spam
	i# - Switch account (# = account number)

Message actions:
	r/R - Reply/Reply all
	C/M - Copy/Move message to another mailbox
	D/U - Mark/unmark for deletion

Mailbox:
	B - Hide/reveal sidebar
	ctrl-j/k - Navigate sidebar
	ctrl-o - Open selected mailbox
	S - Sync/save mailbox changes
	o/O - Quick/full sync with offlineimap

Search and view:
	ctrl-f - Search mail indexed with notmuch
	ctrl-r - Mark all as read
	l - Limit mail
	v - View/download attachments
	ctrl-u/,, - Seek URLs
